{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32685","headline":"五月一日蒙替本官不得随例入关感怀献送相公 · 李频","name":"五月一日蒙替本官不得随例入关感怀献送相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月倾朝谒紫宸，一朝无分在清尘。\n含香已去星郎位，衣锦惟思婺女隣。\n折狱也曾爲俗吏，劝农元本是耕人。\n知将何事酬公道，只养生灵似养身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}